Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:07.75,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,CRONISTA — multi-agent match broadcast · own emblem, fictional crests and kits · every sentence traceable
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.00,0:00:18.70,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Home: GPT-6 Astra · Away: GPT-6.1 Sol · chosen manually · 120 s live match · same observation, strict JSON
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.95,0:00:31.47,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Pre-match presentation · real audio as played in the live broadcast · first piece only (the whole presentation lasts about 50 s)
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.72,0:00:39.16,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Shared state · coaches decide while the simulation clock waits · broadcast buffer · each coach's validated JSON plan and player orders
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.41,0:00:50.54,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Goal call · real narrator audio as played in the live broadcast · ball in the net, GOAL banner, goal view (height illustrative)
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.79,0:00:59.13,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,V1–V8: schema · citations · numbers · names · coverage · ES=EN · negations · strong claims
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.38,0:01:06.63,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Match stats and player card · passes and shots from confirmed events · distance and top speed (km/h) sampled from engine frames
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.88,0:01:15.08,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Favourite club and player (stored in this browser) · Only my player (and goals) · audience: Fan, Analyst, Follow selected player
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.08,0:01:19.24,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Switched to Spanish · page text and the page's own narration (real Azure Speech audio, as played in this recording)
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.49,0:01:27.29,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Microsoft Foundry Agent Service · AI explanation · read-only tool consultar_eventos · cited events · checked by V1–V8
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.54,0:01:34.00,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Model league of 24 Oct · six models, archived and validated in CI · results describe these matches, not model quality
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.25,0:01:41.69,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Match report /match/246 · page label: writer Microsoft Foundry · gpt-6.1-sol · served from cache · 11/11 sentences passed V1–V8
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.94,0:01:44.89,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Synthetic dataset at /datos · DATASHEET · 10-match JSONL sample to download
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.89,0:01:47.33,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,/api/overlay/246 · the verified match-report updates as JSON for a broadcast overlay
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.58,0:01:53.16,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Azure OpenAI · Foundry Agent Service · Azure Speech · Container Apps + Jobs · Blob · Key Vault · App Insights · ACR · Bicep · GitHub Actions
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.16,0:01:57.41,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,All data synthetic · open source · claims link to evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:01.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI can call a football match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:03.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can it prove what it says?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,CRONISTA: a multi-agent broadcast where\Nevery sentence is traceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:13.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two LLM coaches, GPT-6 Astra and\NGPT-6.1 Sol, manage the teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:18.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,A shared engine resolves the play; a desk\Nof three voices narrates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:24.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Narrator (pre-match presentation): Welcome to the arena:\NAtlético Puertoscuro against Olímpico Nebrisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:30.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Narrator (pre-match presentation): Atlético Puertoscuro line up\Nin a four-two-three-one, with GPT-6 Astra in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:34.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,While the coaches decide, the clock waits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:38.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Both see the same committed state and return a\Nvalidated JSON plan for every player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Narrator (goal call): What a goal! Ismael Barido, goal!\NOlímpico Nebrisa level it, one–one, after 52 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:53.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,The commentator may only analyse with a cited fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:55.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Eight deterministic rules check it;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,a failure is retried once, then becomes a labelled template.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Team and player numbers come from the\Nengine's events and frames:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,passes, shots, distance and top speed in kilometres per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:07.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make it yours:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.87,0:01:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,star a club and a player, follow only that player,\Nand choose a fan, analyst or player view.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.04,0:01:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spanish switches text and voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Narrator in Spanish: «Final del partido. Atlético…»
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.69,0:01:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A versioned Microsoft Foundry agent answers questions\Nwith read-only tools over the confirmed play.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.11,0:01:27.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its sentences pass the same verifier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.74,0:01:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The six models also play each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:33.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every league match has a replay, and the page\Nstates what the results cannot prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.45,0:01:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The same verifier guards the automated match report:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:41.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,click any sentence to see its events, or\Nopen every draft and verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:47.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,All data is synthetic: a documented dataset,\Nand JSON for broadcast overlays.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It runs on Azure OpenAI, Foundry, Speech and Container\NApps, with over three thousand automated checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,CRONISTA: narrate the match, prove every sentence.
